  ('Casablanca arrival day', 'Upon arrival at Casablanca airport, our team will greet you and transfer you to your hotel. Check in and unwind.'),
  ('Casablanca | Rabat | Chefchaouen', 'Visit Casablanca’s Hassan II Mosque and Mohammed V Square. Continue to Rabat to see the Mohammed V Mausoleum and Hassan Tower. Travel to Chefchaouen to explore its charming blue streets. Overnight stay in Chefchaouen.'),
  ('Chefchaouen | Fes', 'Journey to Fes with a guided tour: visit El Kairaouin Mosque & University, South Tower, Pottery Village, Nejjarine Square, the King’s Residence, Tanners, and Jewish Quarter. Leisure time in Fes for overnight stay.'),
  ('Fes | Merzouga Desert', 'Travel southeast through Ifrane (“Little Switzerland”), Azrou Cedar forests, and Midelt. Continue south through the Atlas Mountains to Errachidia and Erfoud. Enjoy a camel trek or 4x4 ride at sunset to your desert camp. Dine under the stars and experience local music. Overnight at your luxury desert tent.'),
